msgid "Benefits"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The following table summarizes the benefits of integrating an OPA based "
"input guardrail that contains the logic\n"
"to perform a quick evaluation or to delegate to a separate LLM via a custom "
"_builtin_ function."
msgstr ""

msgid "LLM-only guardrail"
msgstr ""

msgid "Wasm guardrail"
msgstr ""

msgid "Hybrid (Wasm delegating to LLM)"
msgstr ""

msgid "*Latency*"
msgstr ""

msgid "Varies by model and deployment, commonly seconds"
msgstr ""

msgid "Sub-millisecond"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Varies by model and deployment, commonly seconds when falling back to LLM-"
"based validation"
msgstr ""

msgid "*Cost*"
msgstr ""

msgid "Per-call token costs"
msgstr ""

msgid "$0"
msgstr ""

msgid "Per-call token costs when falling back to LLM-based validation"
msgstr ""

msgid "*Determinism*"
msgstr ""

msgid "Probabilistic -- same input can get different results"
msgstr ""

msgid "Deterministic -- same input, same result, every time"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Probabilistic -- same input can get different results when falling back to "
"LLM-based validation"
msgstr ""

msgid "*Auditability*"
msgstr ""

msgid "Black box"
msgstr ""

msgid "Policy is a readable Rego file, version-controlled"
msgstr ""

msgid "Mixed, black box for LLM-based validation and auditable for Wasm"
