msgid "Conclusion"
msgstr ""

msgid "Implementing OPA-based guardrails in Quarkus LangChain4j provides:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"*Performance*: Sub-millisecond for pattern-matched prompts, vs seconds for "
"LLM-based checks"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"*Cost*: LLM-related costs decrease as the Wasm based validation success rate "
"increases"
msgstr ""

msgid "*Flexibility*: Easy policy updates without code changes"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"*Separate policy life cycle management*: The lifecycle of OPA-based "
"guardrails can be managed independently of the\n"
"application lifecycle."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"*Platform independent implementation*: A Wasm OPA guardrail works the same "
"across different platforms\n"
"(JVM/Node/Python, etc.)"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The combination of Quarkus LangChain4j's guardrail framework, OPA policies "
"and Wasm integration creates a robust\n"
"security layer implementation for AI applications."
msgstr ""

